  {:gate/id "G8"  :gate/name "outward-UNLOCKED-charter-bounded" :gate/unlocked true :gate/attestation "founder Lv7+ PR review (Bootstrap Council attestation premise, CLAUDE.md 2026-06-11); see ADR R3 §gate-unlock 2026-06-21" :gate/rule "live GDS/airline fare ingest UNLOCKED (R3) — CHARTER-BOUNDED, bounds STRUCTURAL: (a) source ∈ {:public free/disclosed, :member-principal member's OWN airline-account creds} ONLY — :paid-terminal (Amadeus/Sabre/Travelport) refused by ingest/assert-clean-source (Rider §2(e)/§2(i)); (b) NO-SERVER-KEY means no custodial UNILATERAL SIGNING key on an etzhayyim automated process — it does NOT mean no automation, and READ-ONLY is exempt (ADR-2605231525 marker). So PUBLIC sources are fetched AUTONOMOUSLY by the actor itself (methods/fetch.cljc, read-only, no key — like kaname/watari/tsumugi); :member-principal needs the member's runtime/creds (consent); the actor's OWN write-signing uses a self-generated did:key (sealed seed, present-only) + member CACAO leash (ibuki/kaname pattern) — appending to the LOCAL log needs no key; (c) G1/G3/G4/G5 unchanged + ENFORCED on ingest — a fare bearing a commission/affiliate/searcher key, or missing positive CO₂, is REJECTED; (d) tsubasa transacts no booking (member self-books). Was: Council Lv7+ + operator gated, :representative-only."}]

